# Backend API URL. Required when using Expo Go on a physical device (phone/tablet).
# Use your PC's LAN IP so the device can reach the backend. Find it: ipconfig (Windows) or ifconfig (Mac/Linux).
# After changing this file, restart Expo with: npx expo start -c
# Example:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.5:5000
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_PC_IP:5000
